Architecture Flow
Browser
   │
   ▼
Route (webconfig-rt)
   │
   ▼
Service (webconfig-svc)
   │
   ▼
Pods (webconfig)
   │
   ▼
ConfigMap Volume
   │
   ▼
/var/www/html/
   │
   ▼
index.html + redhatlogo.png
________________________________________
Step 12: Finish the Lab
Run:
lab finish storage-configs
Purpose
This command:
•	Deletes created resources
•	Cleans cluster
•	Prepares next lab
________________________________________
Key Concepts Learned
Concept	Explanation
Deployment	runs pods
Service	exposes pods internally
Route	exposes application externally
ConfigMap	stores configuration files
Volume mount	inject files into container
________________________________________
Most Important Command in This Lab
oc set volume deployment/webconfig \
--type configmap \
--configmap-name webfiles \
--mount-path /var/www/html/
This command injects configuration files into the container.

